## Part 1 — API & Data Specification

### 🔧 Global Configuration
```
SHARED_CALENDAR_ID = "primary"  // single shared enterprise calendar
REFRESH_COOLDOWN = 30  // seconds
DEFAULT_PROD_DAYS = 7  // Gantt default view
DATE_FORMAT = "YYYY-MM-DD"
TIME_FORMAT = "HH:mm"
```

### Authentication
```
OAuth2 Scope: https://www.googleapis.com/auth/calendar
Credentials: Securely stored OAuth2 Client Token (embedded)
Account: dedicated service account with ONLY Calendar API enabled
```

### API Endpoints Used
```
GET    https://www.googleapis.com/calendar/v3/calendars/{calendarId}/events
POST   https://www.googleapis.com/calendar/v3/calendars/{calendarId}/events
PATCH  https://www.googleapis.com/calendar/v3/calendars/{calendarId}/events/{eventId}
DELETE https://www.googleapis.com/calendar/v3/calendars/{calendarId}/events/{eventId}
```

### Event Title Syntax Schema
```
// DELIVERY
Title Format:  "D# {route} # {driver} # {destination}"
Parsed Fields: type="D", route, driver, destination

// PRODUCTION
Title Format:  "P# {lineName} # {taskDetails}"
Parsed Fields: type="P", lineName, taskDetails
Event start→end determines multi-day span rendering

// ATTENDANCE
Title Format:  "A# {employeeName} ({status})"
Status Values: "Absent" | "Leave"
Parsed Fields: type="A", employeeName, status
```

### Permission Logic
```
Viewer: accessCode = "VIEWER_PIN"
  → canView=true, canAdd=false, canDelete=false
Executer: accessCode = "ADMIN_PIN"
  → canView=true, canAdd=true, canDelete=true
```

### Pull-to-Refresh Logic
```
lastRefresh = 0

function onRefresh():
  now = timestamp()
  if now - lastRefresh < REFRESH_COOLDOWN:
    remaining = REFRESH_COOLDOWN - (now - lastRefresh)
    showToast("Data up-to-date. Try again in {remaining}s")
    return
  fetchAllEvents()
  lastRefresh = now
```

### Conflict & Delete Behavior
```
Conflict: Last-Write-Wins → Google API server resolves by request time
Delete:  DELETE events/{eventId} → permanent removal, NO archive
```

